  <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">What is TutorConnect?</h2>
  <p>TutorConnect features verified academic tutors, helpful subject search filters, direct student-tutor messaging, and transparent hourly rates that draw visitors into an efficient learning environment. Building a well-designed homepage is essential for ensuring students and parents have a positive experience when they visit the platform.</p>

  <h2>Is it online or face-to-face tutoring?</h2>
  <p>The flexibility of HK TutorConnect allows both online interactive sessions and traditional face-to-face tutoring across all 18 Hong Kong districts. Whether you prefer studying from the comfort of home or meeting at a local library in Sha Tin, Kowloon City, or Central &amp; Western, students and parents can easily coordinate schedules directly with their matched tutor.</p>

  <h2>How do I find the right tutor on TutorConnect?</h2>
  <p>If you want to find an ideal tutor on HK TutorConnect, it's easy to do. First, click on "Find Tutors" in the top menu or press the "Book your lesson now!" button above. Here you can filter tutors by subject categories, preferred district, or maximum hourly rate. Once you select a verified tutor that fits your budget and academic needs, submit a booking request for your preferred date and time slot.</p>
